    40	## Statement
    41	
    42	Over ZF the following two statements are equivalent.
    43	
    44	**(1)** The Axiom of Choice ([[def-axiom-of-choice]]).
    45	
    46	**(2) Comparability.** For any two sets $A$ and $B$, either $A \preceq B$ or
    47	$B \preceq A$; that is, there is an injection $A \to B$ or an injection
    48	$B \to A$ ([[def-equinumerous]], [[def-injection-surjection-bijection]]).
