    50	**So comparability is not a triviality about sizes but a choice principle in
    51	disguise.** Everything on this page that compares two cardinals uses trichotomy
    52	of **ordinals**, which is a theorem of ZF; comparing two arbitrary **sets** is a
    53	different matter, and this theorem says exactly how different.
